mic  health condition that could be a Bugaboo  so I had had a personal interest in  these social determinants of health  which is all the information not in the  medical environment but available about  the person that might be used to  understand aspects of how they're doing  and so we also in our submission said if  you invite us to the program we'll try  to show that the 90-day latency claims  are useful we will also try to show that  we can find some of these social  determinants of health which can be  available with in a 72 hour latency and  you can even get it with 24 hours  latency if you know where to look and  the sources to hire will try to get a  low latency model I'll do questions I'll  do questions later that'll work best as  time is tight we'll need to turn the  room over in a short period of time so  we'd be put that in and what what  happened was the group doing the  evaluation and are you apply in February  they're announcing in June and it got to  be late May and they said oh my goodness  it's gonna take till October to figure  out who do permit to go forward with  their proposal and I would tell you that  we're about to see Halloween and finish  October and I've asked them do you think  you're gonna decide and maybe November  December next year or are we just going  to give up on the idea they did have a  Foundation grant a few million dollars  to invite people to do this work but  they're choking on it I don't know but I  do think that this kind of illustrates  the challenge and the complexity of  healthcare especially in the u.s. domain  where we are information rich in many  ways but sometimes you have to use some  of the observations to be kind of like a  information analytics Jujitsu person and  think very clearly and carefully about  what are the goals or other goals  possible what are the resources and  where might be the opportune  to use the kind of condensed horsepower  that knowledge of Mathematica brings to  potentially make a difference so and  with that we have time for Q&amp;A please

